WEBVTT

00:00:29.545 --> 00:00:34.103
i kada je njen trud priznat 2011.

00:00:34.103 --> 00:00:37.543
i dana joj je nacionalna mirovna nagrada za mlade,

00:00:37.543 --> 00:00:39.412
postala je vrlo slavna,

00:00:39.412 --> 00:00:43.456
vrlo popularna mlada djevojka u svojoj zemlji.

00:00:43.456 --> 00:00:46.784
Prije toga, bila je moja kćer,

00:00:46.784 --> 00:00:49.789
ali sada sam ja njen otac.

00:00:50.741 --> 00:00:52.496
Dame i gospodo,

00:00:52.496 --> 00:00:55.643
ako pogledamo ljudsku povijest,

00:00:55.643 --> 00:00:58.471
priča žena

00:00:58.471 --> 00:01:01.847
je priča nepravde,